# Ad-hoc audit/scan tool output (stalks/tools/*.cpp CLIs -- audit_registry_*, unregistered_left_sides,
# etc. -- that dump straight into stalks/ with a name chosen per run). A blanket root-level pattern
# instead of one filename added here per new tool run, since that one-off-filename list kept growing
# stale (new tool output using a name that didn't match any existing entry) faster than anyone
# remembered to extend it. Doesn't touch already-tracked files (.gitignore never hides or untracks
# something already in the index) -- stalks/CMakeLists.txt and the committed
# stalks/unregistered_*_life(s).txt baselines stay tracked regardless; the negation below is just
# explicit documentation of that for CMakeLists.txt specifically.
stalks/*.tsv
stalks/*.txt
!stalks/CMakeLists.txt
